# Admin UI (jsonConfig)

## Files

- `admin/jsonConfig.json` — UI definition
- `admin/i18n/de.json`, `admin/i18n/en.json` — **manually maintained only**
- Other languages — generated by owner via `npm run translate`; do **not** edit or run translate
- Adapter icon: `admin/snapmaker.svg` (io-package `common.icon`)
- README logo: `admin/snapmaker-logo.png` (not used as adapter icon)

## jsonConfig guidelines

- End-user friendly labels; tooltips for host / poll interval
- Sensible defaults; validate required fields
- Every jsonConfig field must exist in `io-package.json` → `native` with a default
- Optional `apiToken` (password) for Luban UUID reuse; successful tokens are also stored in expert state `info.apiToken`

## Config fields (v1)

| Field | Default | Notes |
|-------|---------|--------|
| `host` | (empty) | Machine IP / hostname |
| `pollInterval` | `10` | Seconds (number; clamp to min. 2 s) |
| `apiToken` | (empty) | Optional Luban `server.token` UUID |

## Translations workflow

1. Add keys to `de.json` and `en.json` when changing jsonConfig
2. Keys must match; sort alphabetically
3. Do **not** run `npm run translate`
